From: Ely Office
Subject: LOK: Writer formats every body match of a text, the cursor kept

- .uno:ElyFormatMatches (Find, Formats) formats every exact, case-matched
  Find within one body paragraph, in one undo step, without moving any
  view's cursor or selection. Headers, footers, notes and frames are left.
- Formats is seven tab-separated fields: bold, italic, underline (on or
  off), font name, size in twips, color (RRGGBB or none) and a paragraph
  style's programmatic name; an empty field leaves that format alone.
  Weight, posture, font and size go to Latin, Asian and complex scripts.
- No match, an unknown style or no format given leaves the document as
  it was.
